{"chars": "A cool breeze swirled around them, curling and twisting in a way that ordinary wind never does. It caught the spray from the waterfall and spun it into a tall, shimmering, misty shape. The shape grew taller and clearer until a figure stood on the wet rock in front of them. It was tall and slender, made of swirling air and fine sparkling mist, with long hair that streamed out behind it like blowing spray, and eyes the pale blue of distant ice. When it moved, it made a soft sound, whooo, like wind blowing through a tunnel. Its feet didn't leave any footprints at all. The water droplets on the moss simply rearranged themselves a little wherever it stepped.", "start": [0.25, 0.325, 0.325, 0.325, 0.325, 0.325, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 0.65, 1.062, 1.062, 1.062, 1.062, 1.062, 1.062, 1.062, 1.062, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.762, 1.762, 1.762, 1.762, 1.762, 2.125, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 2.8, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.337, 3.337, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.6, 3.6, 3.6, 3.6, 3.6, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 3.763, 4.25, 4.25, 4.25, 4.25, 4.25, 4.525, 4.525, 4.525, 4.525, 4.525, 4.525, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 5.575, 5.675, 5.675, 5.675, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.987, 5.987, 5.987, 5.987, 6.075, 6.075, 6.075, 6.075, 6.075, 6.075, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 7.5, 7.5, 7.5, 7.5, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.65, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 8.037, 8.037, 8.037, 8.037, 8.037, 8.238, 8.238, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.675, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 9.175, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.225, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 9.588, 10.3, 10.4, 10.4, 10.4, 10.4, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.975, 10.975, 10.975, 10.975, 